title: "DSG Spacetime"
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22755320"
license: "CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0"
abstract: >-
  DSG Spacetime is a customer-hosted governed AI-agent system that separates
  AI reasoning and workflow orchestration from execution authority. It combines
  AI planning, Automation Spacetime, Core Spin stateful continuation,
  Governance Spacetime exact-action authorization, node-to-node capabilities,
  governed execution, and verifiable evidence/proof while allowing existing
  customer systems to remain in their own infrastructure.
